    {
      "title": "What's new in 2026/27 Fantasy: Changes to Bonus Points System",
      "publisher": "Premier League",
      "purpose": "Records the 2026/27 BPS changes. The scoring registry still stores awarded FPL bonus points rather than a full event-level BPS calculator.",
